      "id": "aeeba21e7cd5a56a0f59d5a0ffe7d17fa457aff0",
      "message": "fix(dashboard): datastore names truncate instead of pushing the status off mobile (w4/244)\n\nOn Key Value and Postgres detail pages the name/status row kept its\ncontent width, so the title's truncate never engaged: an accepted\n30-character name pushed the status badge past a 390px viewport and the\npage scrolled sideways.\n\nBefore (390px): Key Value document 390/416 with Available ending at\nx416; Postgres 390/412.\nAfter: the ready row and its pending skeleton row are bounded to the\nheader; the name ellipsizes (full heading text kept), the badge ends at\nx374, and the document is 390/390. Desktop, short names and the Postgres\naction menu position are unchanged."
    },
    "createdAt": "2026-10-12T03:53:05.318019Z",
    "id": "dep-db65j8eui45s738uptv0",
    "status": "queued",
    "trigger": "other",
    "updatedAt": "2026-10-12T03:53:11.663122Z"
  }
]

